# Static responses only. Worker responses get their headers from code (src/server/http/security.ts, T17),
# so no header is ever sent twice. CSP (per-request nonce) and HSTS (custom domain only) are set ONLY
# by the Worker (finalizeSecurity in src/server/http/security.ts), never here.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin

/admin/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
